  "caption": "Most people see Barcelona in the wrong order. Which day would you swap? 👇\n\nThree days that beat the crowds: Sagrada Família booked ahead (tickets are online only, with timed entry), Park Güell's monumental zone on a timed ticket, and Montjuïc on any day but Monday, when the Miró Foundation is closed.\n\nWant it for your own dates and pace? Urban Tales plans your trip in a minute and tells you the story of every stop as you walk. Link in bio.\n.\n.\n.\n#barcelona #barcelonaitinerary #spaintravel #traveltips #urbantales"
 },
